# Commercial assets

## Folders
- Root: design & print
- Music Photography (Commercial)/ — tag: music-photography
- Photography Commercial/ — tag: photography (+ Costume/ → costume)
- Video/ — tag: video (images and/or .mp4 files)
- thumbs/ — optimized WebP thumbnails (auto-generated, gitignored)

## Adding photos
1. Drop files in the right folder
2. Add the filename to src/data/commercialManifests.ts
3. Run: npm run thumbs:commercial
4. New filter types: commercialTags.ts + tags[] on works

## Adding video
1. Put stills and/or .mp4/.mov in Video/
2. Add an entry to commercialVideoItems in commercialManifests.ts
   - kind: "image" for stills / promo cards
   - kind: "video" for playable files (poster extracted automatically)
3. Run: npm run thumbs:commercial
4. Large videos are gitignored — keep them locally or host for deploy
